Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it look back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me straight, Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To be blunt, he did a number on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a real goose egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you to take a look,\Nnot make it more excruciating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass di merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me this fat knob on my noggin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's only right that I make you suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.78,0:00:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting attacked doesn't\Nfeel so good, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad, here's some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think\Nyou were better than us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You limpy cazone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Something fell off him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario Zucchero says he's from Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a Roman thug doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, is that a piece of\Ntrash stuck to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, maybe\Nit's a piece of seaweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd much rather it be seaweed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's something about\Nit that screams plastic to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, it pains my soul\Nto think it might be trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That means these beautiful waters\Nare teeming with pollution.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cool with me inspecting\Nthe specimen. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Butt Munch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked to take a closer look\Nat that thing on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You could at least have the common\Ndecency to answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Capri.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, when the ancient Greeks\Nbegan to colonize the Mediterranean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,explorers sought out the most stunning\Nlandscapes of the Great Cerulean Expanse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon discovering the isle, they\Nknew they'd found their destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It is an area blessed with azure\Nwaters and brilliant skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Steep ivory cliffs soar above the\Nsea like a single grand fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One Roman emperor even built\Nprivate villas on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,where he remained until\Nhis death 10 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the mystifying locale sits\Nbefore Bruno Bucciarati and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hidden on it, a dazzling\Nfortune worth 10 billion lira.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, we should map out our\Nroute to the island, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.42,0:04:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been on the lookout for a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but I haven't spotted any more\Nenemies still trying to tail us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's no way that anyone would\Nknow this boat is heading to Capri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I want to know who told that\Nbastard about the secret fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The way he knew about our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He had to have been working with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I noticed you've been\Neyeing these things for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're for sure not mine, so I'm not\Nreally sure how they got on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Loser's choice, which one should I use?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The glasses or the fishing line?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't get some answers out\Nof you, it's not gonna be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your answers will help keep us\Nout of danger, so spill your guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not working alone, are you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Zucchero?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, your partner's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's why I'll be using these.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Still don't know which one\Nyou want me to use, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can't decide,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to use both and see\Nwhich one gets the best results!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now are you in the mood to chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario Zucchero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven, hell, purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven, hell, purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You lucked out, my man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Purgatory it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't fess up\Nabout the name and powers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,of your stalker friend\Nthen I suppose we're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,done you might want to\Nstart worrying about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the well being of your\Ngood eye hear what I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,saying you bobble-headed turnt burglar how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,long are you gonna dick\Naround idiots come look
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,at this he was using the\Nboat's radio so moody
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,jazz's replay found\Nsomething let's check it out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,this boat may have been\Nflatter than a pizza
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but now it's all back\Nto normal along with our
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,culprit here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,haven't earned my trust
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,yet so you don't get\Nthe privilege of looking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,turn around you're lucky\NI'm even letting you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,hear his voice his\Nreplay clearly shows him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,using the radio in the\Ncabin to contact someone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know who\Nhey I'm already holding
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,four of them hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's down to Bucciarati and the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be done before you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,can miss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.66,0:07:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to Capri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They still haven't come out and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard hurt everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But once I get rid
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,of his bootlickers, I'll\Nmake Zipper Boy squeal. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the name of that yacht again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Lagoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, identify your whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about two hours away from landing on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Capri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati is trying to\Nlose potential pursuers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,by taking a roundabout way to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a speedboat to\NCapri and meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick Marina Grande.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The radio cuts out after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just perfect. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.64,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That speedboat is gonna get him\Nto Capri in less than 30 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he's already on\Nthe island. You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell was\Nthat guy on the other end?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, no more games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for this sunburned ballsack to\Ntell us exactly what we want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's a diehard mafioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting him to come clean\Nis going to take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt he'll be spilling his guts today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he did talk, we don't know\Nif he's seen his partner stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's likely he kept it\Na secret, even to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where does that leave us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just go to the\Nharbor and take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine what'll happen\Nif the guy finds out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuccaro isn't the only\None left on this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have an hour to get\Nthe boat to Marina Grande.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't, the guy on the radio will\Nthink something happened to Zuccaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that happens, we can\Nkiss that fortune goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:08:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be lucky to make it\Nback to Napoli in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your call. What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Indecision isn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to take action\Nand outsmart our opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make it to that island before...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now before this boat docks...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone needs to scout ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking this guy out\Nfirst is our best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what the hell are you\Nyammering on about, newbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be a freaking\Nidiot if you think one of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,us can get to the island\Nfaster than this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How would we even do that? Swim? Yes. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use my stand to turn\Nthis buoy into a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, it can pull someone\Nalong faster than this boat can sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my stand, so I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:09:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing is going to get\Nin the way of my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want that ten billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use it to make Bucciarati a Cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use the money to work\Nour way up through the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then knock yourself out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've dreamt up some clever idea, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad you don't have a clue as\Nto his name or what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the port of Capri is\Ncrawling with lots of tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think you're gonna\Nfight him in a crowd of peacockers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually with Giorno on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So we don't know the\Nidentity of this asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's waiting for Zuccaro\Nto arrive in this boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,then I think we've got a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta take it, no\Nmatter what the risk is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wait for him to make his move?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard won't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, about that fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How many people can it take, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand, Six Bullets, is\Nspecifically designed to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means they're more than\Nup for this little mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Swimming over here from the boat\Ntook a bit longer than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have 20 minutes before the\Nmeeting with our men of mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to finish the job quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, how's it looking from the marina?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakio wasn't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are tourists everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They all seem to be waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:12:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, most of them are waiting\Nfor arriving ships. But still?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Signore, we only have 20\Nminutes to weed this guy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a plan on how we're\Ngoing to do that, or do we improvise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it you haven't noticed\Nit's way past lunchtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'd really like to do is\Ngo to that restaurant there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But everyone knows the\Nrestaurants right on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the water serve that shitty touristy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any idea\Nwhat the enemy looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.10,0:12:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm guessing he\Nwouldn't be able to say the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,same for me since I'm a\Nmember of Bucciarati's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eddie's seen your face by now too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm not following\Nyour train of thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can speak my mind for a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I said we had 20 minutes left,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but if he's a worrywart, we might\Nonly have 10 minutes to get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Five if he gets antsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He may get suspicious when\Nthe lagoon fails to arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and catch on to the fact that\Nsomething shady happened to Zucchero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If that happens, our man\Nwill go off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't waste another\Nminute sitting around
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- What part of lunch break don't you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lunchtime now, so I'm eating lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to any boutique or bookstore in\Nthis country and you'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can work on an empty stomach. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm obviously nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But these little fellas take\Nthe custom pretty seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down now, you'll\Nall get your num-nums.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Salame Toscano and Bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get me some of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, number three,\Nknock it off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hogging the meat\Nand making number five cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of the bickering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of food for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one thinks he works the hardest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so each one thinks he deserves\Nthe most food when it's chow time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I make it a point to ensure\Nno one gets left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep crying about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the deal, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of those things do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't call them things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They get really irritated\Nwhen you treat them like pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There are six of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but you won't find a number four\Nbecause it brings nothing but bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have one of these guys for\Neach of the bullets in my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to break up the party, but\Nthis guy wants us to get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure would be nice if you guys could\Ntake your nap after you finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit it, number three!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I just say about hitting? Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're gonna say,\Nbut I'll get him on task.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We should get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and grab the\Nradio out of that bag there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're done working, it's gobble time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's balls to the walls, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make my way\Nto the guard shack and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,use its shadow to conceal\Nmyself from peering eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I please have your attention\Ncalling all passengers at the lagoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Any lagoon passengers out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a message from Signore Zuccaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please make your way to the\Nguard shack on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, calling all\Npassengers at the lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a message from Signore Zuccaro\Nthat requires your immediate attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's playing it safe and\Nignoring the announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Or he thinks they've found the loot,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:16:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's about to jump out and\Ncelebrate being 10 billion lira richer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever hears the\Nannouncement and heads to the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,guard shack to get their\Nmessage is our mystery man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone makes a move toward\Nthe guard shack, give me a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever answers that call is\Ngoing to get a head full of lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, Bucciarati wants that ass\Nalive, so I should avoid his vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see how that goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No one wants to make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's heading over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,ATTENTION!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,THIS IS THE LAST CALL!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,CALLING ALL PASSENGERS OF THE Lagoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,WE HAVE A MESSAGE FROM SENIOR\NEZUCERO THAT REQUIRES YOUR ATTENTION!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,NO ONE YET!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,NOTHING'S HAPPENING!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,HE'S GOTTA BE ON THE ISLAND SOMEWHERE!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,COULD HE REALLY BE PLAYING\NIT SAFE AND HIDING OUT?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.94,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zookero, if something happened,\Nwhy did you request an announcement?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's showing up at the damn shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.77,0:17:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But when did he...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That lookout must have another entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And that bastard knew\Nexactly where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dark to see his face,\Nand Mista hasn't noticed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If things don't turn around, he'll\Ncatch on to our ruse and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to let Mista know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy from the radio is finally coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's coming to the lookout, Chaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's going to the lookout!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay put!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is by the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of Bucciarati's goons!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Zucchero was supposed to get rid\Nof him while he was on that boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.48,0:18:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The target is on the radio!\NMista! Damn it! He can't hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,On your left! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already on the radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pass, pass, pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.68,0:18:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, six bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.17,0:19:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Did he get him? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, what was that noise? Gunshots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, did I disturb you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm sure it wasn't as bad\Nas anything you hear in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But if my work really\Ndisturbed your day...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of something right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll address all your\Ncomplaints once I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's always in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Rear entrance, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:20:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have made his way in through that\Ndoor in order to use the radio unnoticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Either he's taking caution\Nto a whole new level?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,or the sneaky bastard has a weird habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,of always trying to enter\Nbuildings on the down low.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, that was some\Nkiller work, Buds! Yay! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We got his leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We got that right leg good, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd say you nailed the sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.22,0:20:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The usual tourists out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Back here is a friggin' cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No way he climbed that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be stumbling around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be hiding in that truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's a stand user,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then he's more than likely a\Nclose-range one with striking power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If he were the long-range type,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,it's safe to say he would have\Nattacked me a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that he's got a bum leg, he's not\Ngoing to be traveling any kind of distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's probably laying a trap for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he's behind this truck\Nwaiting to lure me in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like he could\Nhurt me even if I did get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.34,0:21:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably just beyond there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.66,0:21:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still in the dark as\Nfar as what his stand can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Going in without backup would\Nbe risky, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I should wait for Giorno and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that option's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Strontos in the driver's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have jump-started the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him escape\Nnow, especially here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn this prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.08,0:21:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know what the guy\Nlooks like, and neither does Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand will have to\Nstay a mystery for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for the 10 billion and Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.16,0:21:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I close my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wake up feeling so horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.44,0:22:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.52,0:22:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.42,0:22:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you won't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.90,0:22:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my mind. All I\Nwant to do is free to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
